 ## Contributing
 
+Applications composing their own tools can use `create_server(saved_session, additional_instructions=...)`.
+An external sign-in adapter can call `saved_session.sign_in_with(callback, site)`: the callback receives the
+site's `AmazonSession`, even when signed out, under the same lock as tool calls. It must verify and publish the
+session before returning. This extension does not install a viewer or change the built-in `sign_in` tool.
+
 Want to contribute financially? If you've found `amazon-orders-mcp`
 useful, [sponsorship](https://github.com/sponsors/alexdlaird) would
 be greatly appreciated!
